  "custom_logic_notes": "Uses CronexChaikin custom indicator which combines Chaikin Accumulation/Distribution with dual EMA smoothing and a signal line. The EA reads buffer 0 (main Chaikin line) and buffer 1 (signal line) from the custom indicator. Entry is based on crossover of these two lines. Opposite signal first closes any existing position, then opens a new one in the signal direction. SL/TP are applied in points without digit adjustment - values are raw point values.",
